# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Read verbatim from the build output root, same as
# _headers. Static assets win over rules here, so a rule only fires once the old
# path no longer builds.
#
# /card was the physical-channel endpoint until 12 Aug 2026, when it was renamed
# to /rwm2026. Business cards and NFC chips are already out there encoding the
# old URL and can't be recalled, so this stays permanently.
/card    /rwm2026    301
/card/   /rwm2026    301

# /terms-of-service is the canonical path (it is the URL registered with Stripe
# and referenced from the checkout consent box). /terms is what people type and
# what a reviewer guesses, so it resolves rather than 404s.
/terms              /terms-of-service    301
/terms/             /terms-of-service    301
